  "slug": "paprika-and-lime-chicken-wings",
  "title": "Paprika and Lime Chicken Wings",
  "blurb": "Tender chicken wings rubbed with paprika and finished with a squeeze of fresh lime.",
  "steps": [
    "Pat the chicken wings dry with kitchen paper and place them in a bowl.",
    "Drizzle the wings with olive oil, then sprinkle over the paprika, salt and black pepper. Toss everything together until the wings are evenly coated.",
    "Heat your grill to medium-high.",
    "Place the wings on the grill and cook for 15 minutes, turning every few minutes, until the skin is golden and the meat is cooked through.",
    "Transfer the wings to a serving plate and squeeze the lime over them while they are still hot."
